  "obWelcomeBody": "You say what you need and by when. The app watches Doctolib in the background and tells you as soon as an appointment frees up in that window, not for a slot three months away.\n\nThree quick settings and you're done.",
  "obLanguage": "App language",
  "allowNotifications": "Allow notifications",
  "obNotifBody": "This is how the app tells you. Without this permission it keeps searching but cannot tell you anything.",
  "notifGranted": "Notifications allowed",
