  "obBatteryTitle": "Let the app run in the background",
  "obBatteryBody": "Android puts apps to sleep to save battery. If the app is put to sleep, it stops checking and you will not receive anything.\n\nLet it run without restrictions: this is the number one reason apps like this \"stop working\".",
  "batteryGranted": "The app can run in the background",
  "batteryPending": "Still restricted by battery saving",
  "removeRestrictions": "Remove restrictions",
  "openAppSettings": "Open app settings",
  "obBatteryOem": "On Samsung, Xiaomi, Huawei, Oppo or OnePlus you often also need to add the app to the \"protected apps\" or exclude it from optimisation in the manufacturer's settings.",
  "quietHours": "Quiet hours",
  "obQuietBody": "During these hours the app checks nothing and never rings. You sleep in peace, and it cuts the number of requests sent to Doctolib too.",
