  "teleBody": "Many practitioners offer both, and a video slot often frees up much sooner than an in-person one.",
  "howToAlert": "How should we tell you?",
  "howToAlertBody": "Set per alert: a paediatrician for a sick child deserves a ringing phone, a routine check-up does not.",
  "callHint": "Green button: opens the appointment directly. Red button or no answer: a regular notification stays. The ringtone and its length are set in Settings. Quiet hours always win: nothing rings at night.",
  "filters": "Filters",
  "filtersBody": "Doctolib offers none of these filters. They are applied in the app to the slots received, so you only hear about what you could actually attend.",
