  "about": "About",
  "howItWorks": "How it works",
  "howItWorksBody": "The app queries the same JSON endpoints that doctolib.fr itself uses when you browse it. Nothing leaves the phone: no account, no server, no health data stored. Booking happens on Doctolib, in your browser.",
  "personalUse": "Personal use",
  "personalUseBody": "These endpoints are undocumented and may change without notice. Keep a reasonable pace and strictly personal use.",
